        "",
        "Product Advantages",
        "1. Adopts a relatively deep U‑shaped cell.\n2. The impeller blades are backward‑inclined at a certain angle, featuring low pressure head, large circulation volume, low power consumption and simple structure.\n3. A porous cylindrical air distributor is installed inside the impeller chamber to realize uniform air dispersion.\n4. Options including top‑side aeration, automatic oil lubrication and automatic liquid‑level control are available.\n5. Production specification range: 1 m³‑160 m³.\n6. Effective volume range: 1 m³‑160 m³.",
