        "Performance Features",
        "1. Large aeration volume with uniform air dispersion and low power consumption.\n2. Simple structure for easy maintenance. Wearing parts such as impeller and stator suffer little wear, cutting operating costs by 70~80%.\n3. Excellent pulp‑circulation performance with low reagent consumption, reducing consumption by 10~15%.\n4. Combined units can be arranged at the same elevation to form a flotation circuit without froth pumps.\n5. If customers require automatic control devices for pulp level and aeration rate, multiple automatic‑control functions including manual/automatic switching and local/centralized control are available.",
